WEBVTT

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.760
Don't miss that brightly shining light!

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.870
It's always there beside you.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:26.420
I'm sure the rest just depends on your perception.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:31.590
You don't have to search for it—just notice that it's there!

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:37.350
There's a tenderness that lies hidden behind the most common things:

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:43.230
a light that showers our days in color!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:49.230
Tiny Days: This world is constructed...

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:54.800
Tiny Days: ...by fragments of miracles!

00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:00.180
Things that seemed meaningless

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:05.730
were actually protecting us, loving us, more than we ever knew.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:10.960
Tiny Heart: Our feelings flow forth...

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.000
Tiny Heart: ...as we give thanks for everything we've been given.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.490
We'll never, ever forget...

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:27.700
We'll cherish this feeling forevermore!

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:35.000
Jinrai Has Arrived!

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:42.320
<b>Summer Edition</b>

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:43.190
Poke.

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:43.840
<b>Summer Edition</b>

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:44.920
Poke, poke!

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:51.590
<b>Summer Edition</b>

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:54.440
Sure enough, this is the swimsuit I want.

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:55.560
What do you think?

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:01.750
Come on, Gourai. Anything?

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:03.180
I'm not sure I...

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:07.060
l mean, we're all planning to go to the beach this summer, so-

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:07.940
Hya!

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:08.820
Huh?

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:12.440
Whoa, wait, what?!

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:14.070
Jinrai has arrived!

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:17.570
Whaat?! How did you get here?!
We're on the fifth floor!

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:18.570
I challenge you!

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.330
Wait a minute.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:23.290
You said your name is "Jinrai"? Just calm down.

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:26.330
I cannot! I've come here to collect data.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.580
I must battle at once. Where is Gourai?!

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:32.100
Nice to meet you, Jinrai. l am Gourai.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:35.270
I never thought you'd actually be activated.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.930
Hold on! Time out!

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:42.680
Jinrai, I get what you're after... but why did you come in through the window?

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.230
You ripped my curtain to shreds!

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.600
The enemy must be cornered!

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:46.390
Huh?

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:49.310
This is a surprise attack! Our conflict already rages!

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.570
Um, our "conflict"? This isn't the Warring States Period...

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:54.470
You are Gennai Ao?

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:56.570
That's right. Nice to meet you.

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:00.000
I assume you are no ordinary girl.
If you are Gourai's assistant, that is.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:04.290
Huh? What's wrong? You okay?

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:06.540
I-I can't stop trembling with excitement!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.720
Say, what is that you've got on your eye?

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:13.010
How astute of you to ask.

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:15.510
When I wear this, I can hear it...

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:21.470
The sound of the horses as the armed cavalry of the Date family galloped across the earth...

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:22.980
Huh?

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:25.970
Do you not know of Date Masamune, the great military commander?!

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.470
He is a hero!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.680
I get it. You're playing pretend, huh?

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:32.180
I don't much like the sound of that.

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:34.740
I both honor and respect Lord Masamune.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:38.360
Also, wearing this brings me a rush of excitement!

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.160
Ah, gotcha. Like you're dressing fancy, huh?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.870
Th-That's not important! I demand a battle at once!

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:47.630
Um, yeah, do you mind if we battle later?

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:51.050
We're pretty busy coming up with plans for summer vacation.

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:52.370
Right, Gourai?

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.630
She's right, Jinrai.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.000
Ah! Jinrai, you should come along with us!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.670
And who are you?!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:03.010
I'm Base. We're all going on a summer trip to the beach!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.080
I'm Stylet.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.510
We're Materia.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:10.030
You all speak of summer vacation?

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.770
You were the one human able to activate Gourai!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:17.220
Are you even aware that you're the chosen one?!

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:19.790
"Chosen one"? That's going too far.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.280
It was just luck, that's all.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:26.660
Which do you think is more important,
summer vacation or a battle that will help collate data?!

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:28.820
Well, that's...

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:30.710
It's summer vacation, of course!

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:34.170
The whole reason for doing these battles is so we can have a fun summer vacation!

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:37.390
In that case, I shall launch my own attack!

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:38.380
Ow. Ow!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.880
Why are you coming after me?

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.000
Please stop this, Jinrai.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:44.510
What's with you, Gourai?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:47.350
l will not allow you to attack Ao!

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.810
Gourai...!

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:51.900
Let us begin a battle session.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:53.810
You and me, one-on-one!

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.900
With pleasure.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:04:59.900
Okay, all set.

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.190
You've gotten used to this, Ao.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:06.280
l guess. After all, it looks like I'm the chosen one...

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.780
l <i>will</i> beat her.

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:11.040
Do your best and finish things up quickly.

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:15.300
Gourai!

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:16.210
Jinrai!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.510
Frame Arms Girl Session...

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:19.430
Go!
Here I come!

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:33.180
Gourai has arrived! Victory is certain!

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:39.770
A restless spirit... A racing heartbeat...

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:43.190
Such is my passion!

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.300
Gourai! Are you okay?

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:53.880
Yes. Commencing counterattack.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:57.870
Not bad.

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.170
Gourai! Be careful!

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.220
You're quite good, Gourai.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.090
And you as well, Jinrai.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:10.260
This ends here!

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:13.160
Try it. You'll go home with your battle data...

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.180
of how l won!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.100
How naïve!

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.160
She's moving so fast that she's leaving afterimages.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:24.240
She's too quick...
Which one is the real Jinrai?

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.490
l can't tell, so let's attack them all.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.660
Uh... Oh, yeah! The new weapon!

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:34.300
Gourai, use this to shoot them all!

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:35.330
Understood.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:40.050
Violence Ram Double Cannon Mode!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:52.940
So incredibly powerful!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.320
Winner: Gourai.

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:58.530
I wasn't that sure I'd put it together properly.

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.150
It broke...

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:12.270
Oh, jeez. It wasn't assembled right.

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:14.580
It shouldn't have exploded...

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:18.450
Dammit!

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:20.660
Jinrai, are you okay?

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.930
It looks like the weapon I put together malfunctioned.

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:26.210
But there's no mistaking the fact that I won.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.600
Gourai, I'm sorry.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:31.300
Well, you've got your data now, right?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.060
No, not yet. It's not enough!

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:36.560
I must have more battles and collect more data!

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:39.670
Do as you like, but the outcome will be the same.

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:42.520
Because, basically, we never lose.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.600
That's right, Ao.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.110
Excuse me!

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:48.860
Why is it suddenly just about the three of you?

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:51.080
There are other opponents right here, you know.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.960
Come on, I'm bored.

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:55.980
Let's all do something!

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:58.500
I mean, Jinrai's here now too!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.210
Jinrai-chan is quite feisty, isn't she?

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:03.640
I'm sure she would look <i>so</i> cute in tears.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:06.290
I'm going to start drooling just thinking of it.

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:09.170
You two, be silent! Our next conflict will be...

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.920
a battle outside the Stage!

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:14.270
Outside it?

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:16.930
So, <i>here?</i> A battle in my apartment?

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:21.680
Yes. Various situations are required to collect as much data as possible.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:25.660
No way! You can't go setting off explosions in here!

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:27.570
They'll kick me out of the apartment!

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:29.660
You don't know anything, do you, Ao?

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:35.280
Ao, Jinrai just pelted you with throwing stars, but you weren't hurt, right?

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:41.870
The energy differential between attacks inside the Battle Stage and outside is <i>this</i> big!

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:43.800
You've got a point...

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:49.380
So, you're saying you wish to collect data outside the Battle Stage?

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:50.250
Correct.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.520
That's sounds kinda fun!

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:53.510
It does.

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:56.320
l can barely contain myself.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:09:00.510
We shall dominate the outside world as well. Let's take our time tormenting them.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:02.020
Let's do it.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.640
So, what kind of battle will it be?

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.440
It shall be...

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:08.370
Gulp!

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:11.280
SUMO!

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:15.400
Huh? S-Sumo?

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.740
A true test of strength against strength.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:23.130
Of speed and split-second decisions!

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:24.620
Fortitude and endurance!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:27.580
Yes: it is the ultimate no-holds-barred match!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.590
You there, you're the referee.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:30.430
Huh?

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:33.140
Yay! I'll do my best!

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:36.980
Well, okay.

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:39.140
Let's do this!

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.640
They're still in it!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.860
Yes, from the Ao Gym,
this is the Rainy Season Tournament.

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:45.270
I, Base, will be acting as referee and commentator.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:48.070
The two remain locked, not moving an inch!

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:49.070
Go, Gourai!

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:50.070
You too, Jinrai-chan.

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:51.190
Good luck!

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:53.360
You're quite good.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:55.110
You as well!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.170
Hyaa!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:11.250
Gourai wins a stunning victory with her spinning throw!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:16.970
And now, the post-match interview.
How do you feel about your recent win?

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:20.970
How do I feel? Um...

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:23.350
Why not just go with "happy"?

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:26.650
Yes. I am very happy, Ao.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:28.100
Then smile.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:35.110
So, now you've collected plenty of data, right, Jinrai?

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.540
No! It's still not enough.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:40.030
More importantly, I want to win!

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:43.330
Whaat? That's not what you said you wanted.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:46.850
l cannot return to Factory Advance until I've won.

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:48.830
I ask that you let me stay here for the time being.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.170
Now you too?!

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.680
Woo-hoo! Looks like things are going to get fun!

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:55.270
I'm ready to fight you anytime.

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:57.600
However, the outcome will always be the same.

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:01.150
Look at you, getting all worked up...

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:03.310
We shall now begin the Grand Tournament.

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:04.900
Everyone, get into the ring!

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.350
Yay!

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:07.700
And <i>you</i>!

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.390
Eep! Yes?

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:12.560
Tap the ring. This match shall be Tap Tap Sumo!

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.940
That makes no sense!

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:24.950
Redecorating is Fun

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.600
Wait right there!

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.230
En garde!

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:48.610
Yay, I'm cleaning with the cleaning robot.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:50.570
Oops, we sucked something up.

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:52.270
Well, whatever!

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:58.190
We nailed it! Now onward, cleaning robot!

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:00.620
This storage box is quite cute.

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:03.140
Ao-chan has excellent taste.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:05.200
It suits us well.

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:06.750
Perhaps we should borrow it.

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:07.870
We shall.

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.020
This place is a mess!

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.010
It's filthy! There's stuff everywhere! It's disgusting!

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:16.640
Clean this up. Clean it!

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:19.180
You guys need to have respect for other people's houses!

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:20.560
Ao's lost it.

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:21.470
Sure has.

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:22.580
She seems angry.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:24.010
Rather assertive, isn't she?

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.260
Seriously, I've had enough!

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:32.310
I'm going to sell these manga at the used bookstore.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:36.090
You all need to clean up your stuff. Got it?!

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:40.180
If you need shelves or furniture,
the building manager gave me some junk...

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:41.540
I mean, stuff you can use.

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:44.260
They're in boxes in the closet.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:46.120
Use them however you like.

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.520
So then...

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:50.600
We get to make our own rooms?

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.600
It would seem so.

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:54.820
Hm. Intriguing.

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:56.120
Could it be something fun...

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.790
...is about to occur?

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:03.340
Hi, Bukiko? I'm about to go sell some manga at Book Super Sato.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:06.340
Let's get together afterward. I'll buy you a parfait!

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:12.070
I shall use the second one at the top.

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:13.500
Huh? Why?

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:17.480
I will climb using spikes and rope ladders. It shall be a form of training.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.180
Gourai isn't able to fly, correct?

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:23.220
I can't, so I'll take the bottom one.

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:26.840
You sound a bit sad about that, don't you?

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.250
I seem sad?

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:30.660
You're cute when trying to put on a brave face.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.960
Sad...

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:37.960
L-Look at t his!

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:41.210
And there's a spear too!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:47.270
Wow! She's so pretty!

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.340
Look, there's a princess!

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:51.110
I have no interest in such things.

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:53.020
It will be perfect for my quarters.

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.600
I'll begin decorating immediately.

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:58.240
Shwip, swhip, shwip and land.

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:05.540
My lord, it's time for your meal.

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:10.450
Is that so, Princess? Very well. You may approach.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:13.860
Base, stop fooling around and do something!

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:15.510
I'm not playing!

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:19.210
This is image training for how I'll decorate my room!

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.840
You use such difficult words...

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:25.680
Black, you shouldn't tease her.
You might make her cry.

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:27.720
Maybe I <i>should</i> try making her cry.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.720
I'm a tough girl, so you won't catch me crying!

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.310
White and Black, you two are doing absolutely nothing!

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:36.480
Styko-chan, you know nothing, do you?

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:37.560
What?

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:39.850
You poor girl.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.980
Everything you two say pisses me off!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.700
Your face is red.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:45.660
You don't have to get so mad.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.420
Just hurry up and do something with your rooms!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:53.160
Not that you <i>can</i> do anything!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:56.830
You would belittle us?
You're so foolish that I have no words.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.120
What?! That makes no sense!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:01.800
My, Styko-chan is mad.

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:03.200
How scary.

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:06.430
What's this? Do you wish to make us tremble?

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:11.240
Are you frustrated?
Why not get mad? Go on, get mad?

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:14.140
Please, get mad. Come on!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.010
Or would you rather cry?

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:21.600
Done.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.840
That was fast!

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.860
Yes. I am finished.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:29.600
Huh? This is all you're doing with your room?

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:30.490
Yes.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.380
It's just a weapons locker!

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:35.630
With this, I'll know where things are in an instant.

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:38.680
It's for Ao, when she preps for our battles.

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:42.500
Yeah, I get that, but isn't it a bit stark?

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.840
Stark?

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:47.960
I'm not sure what could be lacking.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:49.350
Well...

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:51.730
Why not try adding this big bear?

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.480
It doesn't quite seem to match.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.300
Still, it's better than nothing, right?

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.740
Do you think so?

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:03.480
Let's just leave it here for now.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.480
Okay.

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:07.980
I wonder how Jinrai's doing...

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:09.740
Wow!

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.680
It's a full-blown Japanese-style room!
A samurai residence!

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:15.530
No mere samurai residence: a ninja residence!

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.290
<b>NIN</b>

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:22.500
This is beyond what I'd imagined...

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.000
It's <i>too</i> awesome.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.140
But it has zero femininity.

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:28.040
Have you given up your womanhood?

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:30.960
Say what you like! l am thoroughly pleased.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.970
Base... what's with your room?

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.600
It's nothing but junk!
Sugar Candy

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.420
It's not junk!

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:41.810
I can see the big picture!

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.060
Sugar Candy

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:44.760
It's too horrible.

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:49.360
Oh, my. I think it suits Base-chan perfectly.
It's quite free-spirited.

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:53.100
White-neesama, you should be a bit less sarcastic.

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:57.240
This is close to being a cute and wonderful room.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:00.380
Base-chan, what kind of pattern is this?

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:03.030
This wall is <i>very</i> refined.

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:05.250
Right? It's a strawberry pattern!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:08.940
The bed and table turned out pretty well too.

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:10.920
I used an empty candy box
and a handkerchief for sheets.

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:14.340
Garbage detected.

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:19.110
It's not garbage!

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:21.500
It called this "garbage"!

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:22.980
But it's not!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:26.650
It seems your crowning work is considered garbage.

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:27.900
That's cruel!

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:33.650
Still, considering, that bed turned out rather well.

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:37.560
It's not a bed! It's a super cool sofa, of course!

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:38.870
Ah, sorry.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.620
You're all so mean!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.870
This is my room and I like it!

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:44.920
Yay! Spin, spin, spin!

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:46.000
Yay! It's posh and livable!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.720
Base, you really like this?
Yay! It's posh and livable!

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:48.910
Base, you really like this?

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:50.890
Yes. It's so relaxing.

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:53.490
Feel free to come hang out anytime.

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:55.400
Okay! I will!

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:58.650
Now, let me see your room!

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:00.020
Just don't make a mess.

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:01.010
F.A. Girl!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:05.520
Wow! It's awesome!

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:09.940
You can definitely sense your personality from it.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:15.100
As an F.A. Girl, you have to live by DIY: Do It Yourself.

00:18:15.100 --> 00:18:16.360
That's me, all right!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:19.110
Great job! It's so stylish!

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:21.270
Well, I guess it will do.

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:23.750
Huh. She's surprisingly talented.

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:26.300
You wouldn't think it by looking at her.

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:29.880
If we ever need anything for our place, we'll let you make it for us.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:32.630
You two haven't even done anything!

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:35.140
We don't like getting our hands dirty.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.090
We could break a nail, right?

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.670
So, you two don't need a room?

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:41.840
It should be getting here soon.

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:42.800
Huh?

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.160
Wow!

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.780
Just as imagined, yes?

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.610
It fits us to a T.

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:03.280
A doll house? I never thought of that.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:05.860
Did you order it?

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:07.100
Yes.

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:10.000
Anyone can order things online, right?

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:13.540
I'm home!

00:19:13.850 --> 00:19:15.800
Welcome back.

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:20.620
I swear, that appetite... Bukiko just isn't normal.

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:24.770
So then, did you all finish your rooms?

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:29.700
Wow! Th-This is awesome!

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:33.060
I don't know where to start... They're all awesome!

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:34.300
Right?

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:36.230
There's still room to change things up.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:39.570
I worked hard on mine! Give me compliments!

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:42.220
This should help make battles more efficient.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:44.060
Payment for this...

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:47.270
...was taken from your bank account.

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:50.790
Huh? From my account? A withdrawal?

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:56.040
Yes. That is why you're collecting data on us.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:58.470
So, you used <i>my</i> money?!

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:01.520
That's my "part-time job"!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:04.020
Wait, how much was this?

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:07.310
It was expensive, wasn't it?
This totally looks like it was expensive!

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:11.720
The money you've collected so far was enough somehow, so not to worry.

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:14.060
It was "enough"? What does that mean?!

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:17.530
Though, truthfully, I wanted the velour curtains as well.

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:22.280
But there wasn't enough money from the data collection,
so we'll make do till next month.

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:24.530
You spent <i>all</i> of it?!

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:30.540
But it's a relief that our rooms are all done now. Right, Ao?

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:33.040
Uh, no.

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:37.540
The fact that one is still empty is sort of a red flag.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:42.600
I don't believe it...
All the work I've done has been for nothing.

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:47.350
And thanks to Bukiko, I already spent all the money I got from selling manga.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:56.320
I ain't got no money!

00:20:56.320 --> 00:21:00.480
You all better hurry up and fight!

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:02.990
Gather more data!

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:09.010
I need money! Money!

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:14.120
They'll soon show up at your door,

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:19.520
for my special someone, parts of hearts!

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:29.800
Counting the days I can't see you,

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:37.250
I want to hear your voice so badly I feel like crying!

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:40.740
I'm new to this world,

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:44.210
so I lack the language to describe it.

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:46.480
To knockoffs, say...

00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:49.930
"No!" Take care to avoid them.

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:53.450
I want to be be dedicated!

00:21:56.840 --> 00:22:02.150
I want to build it all from nothing!

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:05.380
We laugh and we fight,

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:08.990
creating our unique specs!

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:14.910
By mixing love and hate,

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:22.980
I want to create more of these funny, carefree days, the parts of Girl!

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:42.460
Ao. Your tap technique is lacking!

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:45.380
Such taps aren't suited for Tap Tap Sumo at all!

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:46.930
You need to keep your wrists like <i>this!</i>

00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:47.640
Like this?

00:22:47.640 --> 00:22:48.010
No! Like <i>this!</i>

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:48.860
The Errand Race
Architect is Activated

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:49.660
Like this?

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:52.610
Next time on Frame Arms Girl, let's tap together again!

00:22:52.610 --> 00:22:54.070
You mean have a session, right?

00:22:54.070 --> 00:22:55.020
Architect is Activated
The Errand Race
